# What @ApiTest switches on besides @WebFluxTest's own web layer: Spring Security, the services' shared security chain
# and access rules, correlation ids, and BlockingJpa (on the no-op transaction manager). No database, Kafka or Redis.
org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.security.reactive.ReactiveSecurityAutoConfiguration
com.bank.upgrade.common.autoconfigure.ResourceServerSecurityAutoConfiguration
com.bank.upgrade.common.autoconfigure.CorrelationAutoConfiguration
com.bank.upgrade.common.autoconfigure.MessagingAutoConfiguration
